@startuml 10-state-bookcopy
title State Diagram — BookCopy

skinparam defaultFontName "Tahoma"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F8F5
  BorderColor #34495E
  ArrowColor #2E4053
}

[*] --> AVAILABLE : copy registered
AVAILABLE --> ON_LOAN : borrow accepted (BR-04)
AVAILABLE --> RESERVED : assigned to first waiting reservation (BR-10)

RESERVED --> ON_LOAN : READY owner borrows before expiry
RESERVED --> AVAILABLE : reservation cancelled or expires\n(copy may be assigned to next queue entry)
ON_LOAN --> AVAILABLE : returnBook()\n(no waiting reservation)
ON_LOAN --> RESERVED : returnBook()\n(waiting reservation assigned after commit)
ON_LOAN --> LOST : scheduler\n[overdueDays > 60] (BR-08)
LOST --> AVAILABLE : returnBook()\n[physical copy recovered]

state DAMAGED

note right of DAMAGED
  DAMAGED is a valid stored enum value,
  but no current API or UI transition sets it.
  Return-condition, repair, and disposal flows
  are not implemented.
end note

note bottom of RESERVED
  Only the owner of an unexpired READY reservation
  may borrow this reserved copy.
end note

@enduml
